      "writtenOn": "2026-10-14T20:47:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The saved UART states (baudrate, parity, interp_connect) should be restored here to ensure the servo is returned to a usable state for the console. Call `self.servo.restore_state(\"ec_uart_baudrate\")`, etc.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 77,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 77,
        "endChar": 0
